    "created_at": "2024-05-17T08:26:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-05-17T08:27:47Z",
    "body": "Thanks, @foolip!\r\n\r\nI'll file a spec issue for permissions API support soon.\r\n\r\nAn [alternative](https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/html-fullscreen-without-a-gesture/blob/main/README.md#considered-alternatives) and [separate explainer](https://github.com/w3c/window-management/blob/main/EXPLAINER_initiating_multi_screen_experiences.md) considered multiple operations per gesture, but that indeed fails application-driven use cases, while adding substantial complexity.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
