    "created_at": "2024-05-23T00:24:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-05-23T00:24:59Z",
    "body": "I honestly wonder if we even need this in the spec? If it's browser-level configurable by a user, then it could just happen transparently (in that the transient activation for this particular case is implied by the browser setting). ",
